(Fernhill Instruments Information Security Policy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Sample content for the RAG Starter Kit demo. Fernhill Instruments is a fictional company.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Passwords and authentication) Tj T*
(All accounts must use a password of at least 14 characters. Passwords are stored in the) Tj T*
(company password manager and must never be reused across services. Multi-factor) Tj T*
(authentication is mandatory for email, source code hosting, the cloud console and the) Tj T*
(Fernhill Portal. Hardware security keys are required for administrators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Access reviews) Tj T*
(Team leads review who has access to production systems every quarter. Access for people who) Tj T*
(leave the company is removed on their last working day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Laptops and devices) Tj T*
(Company laptops use full-disk encryption and lock automatically after five minutes of) Tj T*
(inactivity. Personal devices may only access email through the managed mobile app.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
