BT
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
56 790 Td
(4. Incident response) Tj T*
(Report any suspected security incident to the security team within one hour of discovery,) Tj T*
(using the #security-incidents channel or the on-call phone number in the IT portal. Do not) Tj T*
(try to investigate on your own and do not delete evidence.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Incidents are classified by severity. Severity 1 means customer data is exposed or) Tj T*
(production is down; the incident commander is paged immediately and customers are informed) Tj T*
(within 72 hours when their data is affected. Severity 2 covers contained incidents without) Tj T*
(customer impact.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Data retention) Tj T*
(Security logs are retained for 400 days. Customer sensor data is kept for five years unless) Tj T*
(the customer requests earlier deletion. Backups are encrypted and tested for restore every) Tj T*
(month.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Policy owner) Tj T*
(This policy is owned by the Head of Security and reviewed once per year.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
